  "title": "1Password at York",
  "original_html": "<div class=\"entry-content\">\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:10px\"></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover is-light full-width\" style=\"min-height:403px;aspect-ratio:unset;\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim-0 has-background-dim\"></span><img alt=\"1Password Background Image\" class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-1584\" data-object-fit=\"cover\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"1293\" sizes=\"(max-width: 3361px) 100vw, 3361px\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/05/training.png\" srcset=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/05/training.png 3361w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/05/training-400x154.png 400w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/05/training-1024x394.png 1024w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/05/training-1536x591.png 1536w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/05/training-2048x788.png 2048w\" width=\"3361\"/><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-cover-is-layout-flow\">\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-large-font-size\"></p>\n</div></div>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:10px\"></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-horizontal is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-499968f5 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-vivid-red-background-color has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"https://team-yorkuniversity.1password.ca/signin\">Login</a></div>\n</div>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:10px\"></div>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">Passwords have become a fixture in our everyday lives, especially in the modern workplace. 1Password is a password management tool used to generate, store, and securely share passwords all in one centralized platform. Keeping track of multiple passwords for different accounts can become overwhelming. University Information Technology (UIT) at York has made 1Password available to support our community in maintaining strong digital security practices and to simplify the process of password management.</p>\n<div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\" style=\"height:10px\"></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-kadence-column kadence-column1206_207bbb-a4\"><div class=\"kt-inside-inner-col\">\n<p><span class=\"wp-rich-text-font-awesome-icon wp-font-awesome-icon\"><path d=\"M48 24C48 10.7 37.3 0 24 0S0 10.7 0 24V64 350.5 400v88c0 13.3 10.7 24 24 24s24-10.7 24-24V388l80.3-20.1c41.1-10.3 84.6-5.5 122.5 13.4c44.2 22.1 95.5 24.8 141.7 7.4l34.7-13c12.5-4.7 20.8-16.6 20.8-30V66.1c0-23-24.2-38-44.8-27.7l-9.6 4.8c-46.3 23.2-100.8 23.2-147.1 0c-35.1-17.6-75.4-22-113.5-12.5L48 52V24zm0 77.5l96.6-24.2c27-6.7 55.5-3.6 80.4 8.8c54.9 27.4 118.7 29.7 175 6.8V334.7l-24.4 9.1c-33.7 12.6-71.2 10.7-103.4-5.4c-48.2-24.1-103.3-30.1-155.6-17.1L48 338.5v-237z\" fill=\"currentColor\"></path></span> <strong>Note: </strong>Please ensure you are only adding <strong>work-related</strong> items to your Employee Vault.</p>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-ad2f72ca wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns card-deck aspect-ratio fade-bottom is-layout-flex wp-container-core-columns-is-layout-9d6595d7 wp-block-columns-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column card rounded-0 bg-white is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1565\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"513\" sizes=\"(max-width: 770px) 100vw, 770px\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/05/1Password-770x513-1.jpg\" srcset=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/05/1Password-770x513-1.jpg 770w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/05/1Password-770x513-1-400x266.jpg 400w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/05/1Password-770x513-1-391x260.jpg 391w\" style=\"width:303px;height:201px\" width=\"770\"/></figure>\n<div class=\"wp-block-group card-body\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading card-title h5\">Getting Started</h2>\n<p class=\"card-text\">Learn how to set up your account and get started with 1Password.</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"text-uppercase\"><a href=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/?page_id=1548&amp;preview=true\">Learn More</a></p>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-column card rounded-0 bg-white is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1959\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"622\" sizes=\"(max-width: 834px) 100vw, 834px\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2025/07/1p-fams.png\" srcset=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2025/07/1p-fams.png 834w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2025/07/1p-fams-400x298.png 400w\" width=\"834\"/></figure>\n<div class=\"wp-block-group card-body\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading card-title h5\">1Password for Families</h2>\n<p>After setting up your Employee account, learn more about how to setup a free 1Password Families account for up to 5 of your loved ones.</p>\n<p></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/1password-for-families/\">Learn More</a></p>\n</div></div>\n<p></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-column card rounded-0 bg-white is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1960\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"800\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2080px) 100vw, 2080px\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2025/07/1p-stud.png\" srcset=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2025/07/1p-stud.png 2080w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2025/07/1p-stud-400x154.png 400w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2025/07/1p-stud-1024x394.png 1024w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2025/07/1p-stud-1536x591.png 1536w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2025/07/1p-stud-2048x788.png 2048w\" width=\"2080\"/></figure>\n<div class=\"wp-block-group card-body\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading card-title h5\">1Password for Students</h2>\n<p class=\"card-text\">If you are a Student interested in using 1Password, learn how to redeem your free 1Password Student account.</p>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"text-uppercase\"><a href=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/1password-for-students/\">Learn More</a></p>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-column card rounded-0 bg-white is-layout-flow wp-block-column-is-layout-flow\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1585\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"442\" loading=\"lazy\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 707px) 100vw, 707px\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/05/faq.png\" srcset=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/05/faq.png 707w, https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/05/faq-400x250.png 400w\" style=\"width:225px;height:140px\" width=\"707\"/></figure>\n<div class=\"wp-block-group card-body\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow\">\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading card-title h5\">FAQs</h2>\n<p class=\"card-text\">Find answers to all of your questions about 1Password along with a wealth of support articles.</p>\n<p></p>\n<p class=\"text-uppercase\"><a href=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/?page_id=1554\">Learn More</a></p>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-layout-grid wp-container-core-group-is-layout-9649a0d9 wp-block-group-is-layout-grid\"></div>\n</div>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"entry-links\"></div>\n</div>",
  "html": "\n<img alt=\"1Password Background Image\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/05/training.png\"/>\n<p></p>\n<a href=\"https://team-yorkuniversity.1password.ca/signin\">Login</a>\n<p>Passwords have become a fixture in our everyday lives, especially in the modern workplace. 1Password is a password management tool used to generate, store, and securely share passwords all in one centralized platform. Keeping track of multiple passwords for different accounts can become overwhelming. University Information Technology (UIT) at York has made 1Password available to support our community in maintaining strong digital security practices and to simplify the process of password management.</p>\n<p> <strong>Note: </strong>Please ensure you are only adding <strong>work-related</strong> items to your Employee Vault.</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/05/1Password-770x513-1.jpg\"/></figure>\n<h2>Getting Started</h2>\n<p>Learn how to set up your account and get started with 1Password.</p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/?page_id=1548&amp;preview=true\">Learn More</a></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2025/07/1p-fams.png\"/></figure>\n<h2>1Password for Families</h2>\n<p>After setting up your Employee account, learn more about how to setup a free 1Password Families account for up to 5 of your loved ones.</p>\n<p></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/1password-for-families/\">Learn More</a></p>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2025/07/1p-stud.png\"/></figure>\n<h2>1Password for Students</h2>\n<p>If you are a Student interested in using 1Password, learn how to redeem your free 1Password Student account.</p>\n<p></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/1password-for-students/\">Learn More</a></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/wp-content/uploads/sites/806/2024/05/faq.png\"/></figure>\n<h2>FAQs</h2>\n<p>Find answers to all of your questions about 1Password along with a wealth of support articles.</p>\n<p></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.yorku.ca/uit/infosec/?page_id=1554\">Learn More</a></p>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n",
  "text": "Login Passwords have become a fixture in our everyday lives, especially in the modern workplace. 1Password is a password management tool used to generate, store, and securely share passwords all in one centralized platform. Keeping track of multiple passwords for different accounts can become overwhelming. University Information Technology (UIT) at York has made 1Password available to support our community in maintaining strong digital security practices and to simplify the process of password management. Note: Please ensure you are only adding work-related items to your Employee Vault. Getting Started Learn how to set up your account and get started with 1Password. Learn More 1Password for Families After setting up your Employee account, learn more about how to setup a free 1Password Families account for up to 5 of your loved ones. Learn More 1Password for Students If you are a Student interested in using 1Password, learn how to redeem your free 1Password Student account. Learn More FAQs Find answers to all of your questions about 1Password along with a wealth of support articles. Learn More",
